<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Madar sent 90 emails today. That is the daily limit for notice emails on the free plan.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">New notices stay in the app. Emails start again at 3:00 AM Riyadh time.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Invitations and password resets still go by email.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">No action is needed.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;"><a href="https://madar.example/admin" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;background:#1c1b19;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;">Open Madar</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;color:#5f5c55;margin-bottom:4px;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:</p>
