<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#5f5c55;border-top:1px solid #e6e3dc;padding-top:16px;">Madar sent this email. Do not reply to it.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Notice emails stopped for today",
  "text": "Madar sent 90 emails today. That is the daily limit for notice emails on the free plan.

New notices stay in the app. Emails start again at 3:00 AM Riyadh time.

Invitations and password resets still go by email.

No action is needed.

Open Madar: https://madar.example/admin

Madar sent this email. Do not reply to it.
",
}
`;

