<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Someone asked to reset the password of your Madar account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Choose a new password with the button below.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If you did not ask for this, ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p>
