<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;color:#5f5c55;margin-bottom:4px;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;word-break:break-all;" dir="ltr"><a href="https://madar.example/reset?token_hash=abc&amp;type=recovery" style="color:#1c1b19;">https://madar.example/reset?token_hash=abc&amp;type=recovery</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#5f5c55;border-top:1px solid #e6e3dc;padding-top:16px;">Madar sent this email. Do not reply to it.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Reset your Madar password",
  "text": "Hello Sara,

Someone asked to reset the password of your Madar account.

Choose a new password with the button below.

If you did not ask for this, ignore this email. Your password stays the same.

Choose a new password: https://madar.example/reset?token_hash=abc&type=recovery

Madar sent this email. Do not reply to it.
",
}
`;

